@startuml sl-07-support
skinparam dpi 150
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam roundcorner 6
skinparam conditionStyle inside

title Flow 7 — Customer Support, Incident Management & Compensation (Activity Swimlane)

|Storage Customer|
start
:Access Support Portal & submit new support request (ticket);
:Select category (Smart Lock Failure, Unit Water Leakage, Lighting Defect, Billing Query);
:Describe incident and attach photos / videos;

|System|
:Create SupportRequest record with status NEW (BR-SUP-01);
:Route ticket to facility queue based on customer contract facility;

|Facility Staff|
:Review incoming support ticket in Staff Desk;
:Acknowledge ticket & transition status: NEW -> ASSIGNED -> IN_PROGRESS (BR-SUP-02);

if (Incident type) then (PIN Forgotten / Lock Malfunction)
  |Facility Staff|
  :Verify customer identity on file;
  :Generate temporary emergency 6-digit PIN code (valid 24h) (BR-SUP-03);
  |System|
  :Send emergency PIN SMS directly to registered phone number;
  |Storage Customer|
  :Access storage unit with temporary PIN;

else if (Facility Defect: Water Leak / Structural Failure)
  |Facility Staff|
  :Conduct urgent physical inspection at unit location;
  :Assess damaged customer property & log damage evaluation report;
  if (Unit unusable and customer requires alternative storage?) then (yes)
    |Facility Manager|
    :Approve emergency unit swap without extra charge (BR-SUP-04);
    |System|
    :Transition contract storage unit to new AVAILABLE unit;
    :Mark old unit MAINTENANCE;
  endif
  |Facility Manager|
  :Assess compensation claim under Standard (10M VND) or Premium (50M VND) protection (BR-SUP-04);
  :Approve compensation disbursement;
  |System|
  :Credit approved compensation to customer account or process bank refund;

else (General Inquiry / Minor Maintenance)
  |Facility Staff|
  :Resolve physical maintenance or answer customer question;
endif

|Facility Staff|
:Document resolution notes & capture completion photos;
:Transition SupportRequest status: IN_PROGRESS -> RESOLVED;

|Storage Customer|
:Receive resolution notification and rate service quality (1 to 5 stars);

if (Customer accepts resolution or 72h passes without feedback?) then (auto close)
  |System|
  :Transition SupportRequest status: RESOLVED -> CLOSED / AUTO_CLOSED (BR-SUP-05);
else (customer reopens)
  |Storage Customer|
  :Submit follow-up comment;
  |System|
  :Reopen SupportRequest to IN_PROGRESS;
endif
stop
@enduml

